  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pitcairn Financial Aid 2023 to 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the provision of public services to meet the reasonable assistance needs of the people of Pitcairn including health, education and securing sea access, given self-sufficiency is currently not a viable option for this UK Overseas Territory.</narrative>
